  "description": "OpenAI and Anthropic SDK for .NET Framework 4.0+.\n\n      Features:\n      - Unified IAIClient interface for both OpenAI and Anthropic\n      - Built-in AI Agent with automated tool-calling loop\n      - Streaming support via callbacks\n      - MAF-style Skill Manager with progressive disclosure\n      - MCP (Model Control Protocol) client support\n      - Multi-modal (text + image) content support\n      - Structured JSON output with generic type support\n      - Compatible with .NET Framework 4.0+ (no C# 6.0+ features)",
